# B"H
# Boruch Hashem
# Blessed is He
#
# The Awtsmoos renews each boundary without carrying yesterday's shadows.
# Awtsmoos.com keeps source in Git while runtime media, plans, proofs, logs,
# caches, archives, and machine state remain outside.

# Local Awtsmoos tunnel state.
.awtsmoos/
.Awtsmoos/
.awtsmoos-*/
.Awtsmoos-*/
**/.awtsmoos/
**/.Awtsmoos/
**/.awtsmoos-audit/
**/.awtsmoos-agent-thoughts/
**/[aA][wW][tT][sS][mM][oO][oO][sS]/
*.awtsmoos.log
.awtsmoos.local.json
.awtsmoos.config.local.json
.Awtsmoos.local.json
.Awtsmoos.config.local.json
.awtsmoos-*
.ai_tmp_*

